pbwinput 1
# The field menu's apps from the starter save (oracle.py launch party_menus; README.md, "The launch checks"). Both
# programs play this file from the same save (Tepig, level 5, in the party; the Pokedex): the continue sequence's
# presses take CONTINUE into the field at the Aspertia City lookout on the oracle, where X opens the field menu with
# every item: POKEMON, POKEDEX, BAG, the trainer card, SAVE and OPTIONS (FieldMenu_GetMenuType's type 0,
# src/ov036/field_menu.c). Then the party, Tepig's menu and its summary, the Pokedex and Tepig's entry, the trainer card
# and the bag, each closed with B. The port, whose field has no C yet, opens the party list, the card and the bag with
# Frigate's test launcher (--launch party@4044,card@6974,bag@7673) at the counts they open on the oracle, so that the
# presses inside each app reach both on the same pass; the Pokedex, which stops the port on a trap, isn't launched, and
# the presses for the field, its menu and the Pokedex reach nothing on the port. On game frames. Black 2.
version b2_us
1100 START  # START in the opening skips it to the title (count 1115 on both)
1101 -
3000 START  # START brings back the layers the title hid at count 2877
3001 -
3100 START  # START leaves for the start menu, which shows from count 3249
3101 -
3400 A  # CONTINUE: the lookout, from count 3605
3401 -
3900 X  # X: the field menu slides in on the bottom screen
3906 -
3960 DOWN  # the first key shows the cursor, on POKEMON (slot 0)
3966 -
4000 A  # A: the party ("Choose a Pokemon.", Tepig 21/21)
4006 -
4300 A  # A: Tepig's menu (SUMMARY, SWITCH, ITEM, QUIT)
4306 -
4500 A  # A: Tepig's summary (from count 4533)
4506 -
4800 B  # B: back to the party
4806 -
5100 B  # B: back to the field menu, the cursor on POKEMON
5106 -
5400 RIGHT  # RIGHT: the cursor on POKEDEX
5406 -
5430 A  # A: the Pokedex (its opening until about count 5870), the Unova list, seen 1, obtained 1
5436 -
6000 A  # A: Tepig's entry (from count 6036)
6006 -
6300 B  # B: back to the list
6306 -
6600 B  # B: back to the field menu, the cursor on POKEDEX (count 6650)
6606 -
6900 DOWN  # DOWN: the cursor on the trainer card
6906 -
6930 A  # A: the trainer card, with its Pokedex line now
6936 -
7300 B  # B: back to the field menu (count 7357)
7306 -
7600 LEFT  # LEFT: the cursor on BAG
7606 -
7630 A  # A: the bag, its items pocket empty, from count 7680
7636 -
8000 B  # B: back to the field menu
8006 -
8300 B  # B: the menu closes
8306 -
